WEBVTT

00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:18,170
Sounds like there are a lot of positive attributes for the atelier-aramad-ryphachine, higher frequencies, live with harmonic, I have a true-ryphachine.

00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:24,170
What determines which particular ryphachine you choose for each particular patient?

00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:35,170
Well, when you started and when most people listening to this started with us, the atelier-aramad didn't exist.

00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:48,700
So the atelier-aramad is a new ryphachine, and again, the atelier-aramad has just been out the last couple of months.

00:00:49,700 --> 00:01:02,700
So, again, I've told people throughout all of my practice for 35 years that I will never make recommendations based upon my loyalty to a company.

00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,700
I'll only make recommendations based upon my loyalty to my patients.

00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:19,700
So, you know, I've been asked to be part of different companies, different nutritional companies, different therapy companies throughout the years.

00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:29,700
And I have to respectfully decline because what if something better comes along that I would make recommendations for, but then I'm financially tied to a company.

00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:40,700
So, I've never wanted to be financially tied to a company. I want to be tied to my patients well-being and make only recommendations based upon what's best for the patients.

00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:47,700
Now, you know the true ryph was bought out recently and they're making changes for the better.

00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:52,700
A lot of people think that some changes are not for the better.

00:01:52,700 --> 00:02:00,700
That's a matter of opinion. I think there may be some truth in some of that. I still think the true ryph are fantastic machines.

00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:06,700
Would I trade in my true ryph for an atelier-aramad? No, I wouldn't.

00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:11,700
If I was going to buy another machine right now, what would I buy? The atelier-aramad.

00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:21,700
I think the atelier-aramad is superior. And when true ryph hears me say that, they're going to probably be really mad at me because I've been a big purchaser of them.

00:02:21,700 --> 00:02:29,700
But if somebody came to me today and said, which machine should I buy? I'm going to say the atelier-aramad.

00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:36,700
If they came to me today and said, I really wanted true ryph because my sister had a true ryph and she got better.

00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:39,700
I'm not going to argue with them. Let's get you a true ryph then.

00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:52,700
So I don't have any qualms about selling a true ryph and supporting true ryph and continuing to support true ryph moving forward.

00:02:52,700 --> 00:03:01,700
And I think they're great machines. I think now the second best machine on the market.

00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:08,700
Just like what I was just doing true ryph, we were also selling GB 4000.

00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:16,700
And if person came to us with the GB 4000, we tried to help them. The problem with the GB 4000, they're not programmable really at all.

00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:24,700
But we'd give them advice at how to use it and things like that. I think they're good machines. They have a lot of power, but they're antiquated with their program.

00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:32,700
I would seriously antiquate with the program. But so I really pushed people to a true ryph because you could program it.

00:03:32,700 --> 00:03:42,700
Now the atelier-aramad and the true ryph are equal in their programmability. The atelier-aramad is superior in that you can do higher frequencies.

00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:47,700
You can do 11th harmonic frequencies and there's some other things coming down the road.

00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:54,700
Now true ryph, Jacob True ryph said that they're going to upgrade to a new machine.

00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:58,700
You told me that this summer, I don't know when that's coming out.

00:03:58,700 --> 00:04:05,700
But it's a completely new machine that would enable some of these things. I don't know what else he didn't give me any clues.

00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:10,700
What is going to be enabled on that new board that they're going to have for this new machine.

00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:13,700
I can't remember what he told me they're going to call it.

00:04:13,700 --> 00:04:17,700
But it would require a person to buy the new machine.

00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:23,700
We're going to buy a second machine and buy the atelier-aramad.

00:04:23,700 --> 00:04:27,700
If you're like, I can't afford a second machine. I just want the best.

00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:31,700
Should I sell my true ryph and buy an atelier-aramad?

00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:35,700
No, I don't know. I would say no.

00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:45,700
You know, all my staff and the true ryph, all my family still has the true ryph.

00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:50,700
They're great machines. It's just like, if you came to me and said, I want to get a second one.

00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:53,700
Then I'd say, look at the atelier-aramad. You'll have the best of both worlds.

00:04:53,700 --> 00:05:00,700
The negative atelier-aramad is a little bigger. It's not going to be as easy to travel with if you're traveling a lot.

00:05:00,700 --> 00:05:04,700
That is a negative at the atelier-aramad.

00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:10,700
We still are working out some bugs with it.

00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:15,700
But I think it's the better machine.

